# Sample requests. In VS Code, install the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
@host = http://localhost:5025

### Search for a location
GET {{host}}/api/locations/search?q=Toronto

### Current weather for Toronto, recorded in search history
# Send it twice: the second response has "fromCache": true.
GET {{host}}/api/weather?lat=43.70643&lon=-79.39864&name=Toronto&country=Canada&admin1=Ontario&logSearch=true

### Refresh (not recorded in history)
GET {{host}}/api/weather?lat=43.70643&lon=-79.39864&name=Toronto&country=Canada&admin1=Ontario

### Recent searches
GET {{host}}/api/history

### Most-searched locations
GET {{host}}/api/stats?limit=5

### Invalid limit: PL/SQL raises ORA-20001, and the API returns 400
GET {{host}}/api/history?limit=500

### Validation error (400)
GET {{host}}/api/weather?lat=200

### Health check (includes the database)
GET {{host}}/api/health
